{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111568","id":2908449848,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6tW2w4","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111568","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111568.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111568.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111568","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111568/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111568/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111568/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/53de633c5f52f8ccddedf0998d06dccecd75e8da","number":111568,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add sheen shading support","user":{"login":"LiveTrower","id":48926464,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4OTI2NDY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48926464?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower","html_url":"https://github.com/LiveTrower","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Part of https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/1934\r\n\r\nThis PR adds support for sheen shading, which allows for the easier and more realistic creation of cloth materials like cotton, velvet, silk, etc.\r\n\r\nIt only has 3 inputs:\r\n\r\n- **SHEEN:** to control the intensity of the effect.\r\n- **SHEEN_ROUGHNESS:** to adjust the level of roughness or glossiness.\r\n- **SHEEN_COLOR:** to change the specular reflectance color.\r\n\r\nIn the StandardMaterial3D, you can place a texture with the following information:\r\n\r\n- R (Red channel): A mask to indicate which parts are cloth and which parts are not.\r\n- G (Green channel): A roughness map to provide variations in reflections.\r\n\r\nHere are some usage examples so you can see how it looks.\r\n| Cloth Ball | Sweater(cotton) |\r\n|--------------|--------------|\r\n|<img width=\"576\" height=\"324\" alt=\"cloth\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/821654a4-9dfb-4e7b-8812-6612e8e51234\" />|<img width=\"576\" height=\"324\" alt=\"sweater\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5b9c2da1-824f-46c5-b6a7-24135c5b6bda\" />|\r\n\r\n| Dress(silk) |Chair(velvet) |\r\n|--------------|--------------|\r\n|<img width=\"576\" height=\"324\" alt=\"dress\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dfd4d312-09ed-4ebb-a81e-259f4c76233e\" />|<img width=\"576\" height=\"324\" alt=\"chair\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c2bd0775-57a6-4ba8-9e9d-5a04d1915524\" />|\r\n\r\n### ⚠️ Important notes ⚠️\r\n\r\n- There is no support for the mobile and compatibility renderers because they do not support DFG LUT see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103934.\r\n- This implementation is based on Google's Filament, which introduces the following artifacts occur when sheen roughness is set to <= 0.3.\r\n<img width=\"576\" height=\"324\" alt=\"artifacts(white)\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7a5eb683-47e7-45a2-90f7-0b162e0c7c41\" />\r\n<img width=\"576\" height=\"324\" alt=\"artifacts(red)\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/960a7690-d7c0-4de7-859a-9efed53e9966\" />\r\n\r\nI haven't taken the time to report it, nor do I know how it can be solved.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_